{"id":"1d51866fb1f31652","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Open Subspace Topology","display":"df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology — ZFC Topo11 Open Subspace Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology — ZFC Topo11 Open Subspace Topology","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology — ZFC Topo11 Open Subspace Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3482d3dfe87a8b71\" href=\"?note=3482d3dfe87a8b71\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,A,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(\\sigma,A,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3482d3dfe87a8b71\" href=\"?note=3482d3dfe87a8b71\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11OpenSubspaceTopology}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11OpenSubspaceTopology}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}open\\text{-}subspace\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11OpenSubspaceTopology}_S(\\sigma,A,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(X,\\tau,A,\\sigma)\\land A\\in\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}open\\text{-}subspace\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11OpenSubspaceTopology}_S(\\sigma,A,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(X,\\tau,A,\\sigma)\\land A\\in\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The subspace topology is supplied by the canonical four-place predicate; the final conjunct says that the subspace carrier is open in the ambient space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3482d3dfe87a8b71","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3482d3dfe87a8b71","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^4$ is from [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma,A,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11OpenSubspaceTopology}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}open\\text{-}subspace\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11OpenSubspaceTopology}_S(\\sigma,A,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(X,\\tau,A,\\sigma)\\land A\\in\\tau.","display":true}],"bytes":1048,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3687","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology.md|58-df-zfc-topo11-open-subspace-topology]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3482d3dfe87a8b71"]}